      "date": "2026-11-14 22:50:51",
      "content": "<!-- wp:html -->\n<style>\n  .blackbox-terminal {\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    min-height: 360px;\n    padding: 24px 18px;\n    color: #ffd7dc;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 120, 139, .58);\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(circle at 50% 45%, rgba(143, 14, 33, .28), transparent 50%),\n      linear-gradient(145deg, #13060b 0%, #060507 62%, #0c0306 100%);\n    box-shadow:\n      inset 0 0 38px rgba(196, 20, 46, .14),\n      0 0 28px rgba(158, 17, 41, .15);\n  }\n\n  .blackbox-terminal::before {\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: 1;\n    inset: 0;\n    content: \"\";\n    pointer-events: none;\n    opacity: .34;\n    background:\n      repeating-linear-gradient(\n        0deg,\n        transparent 0,\n        transparent 3px,\n        rgba(255, 185, 194, .08) 4px\n      );\n  }\n\n  .blackbox-terminal__codes {\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: 0;\n    inset: 0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    opacity: .5;\n  }\n\n  .blackbox-terminal__code {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 180%;\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #ff7688;\n    font-family: \"Consolas\", \"Courier New\", monospace;\n    font-size: .62rem;\n    letter-spacing: .12em;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    text-shadow: 0 0 7px rgba(255, 88, 111, .92);\n    animation: blackbox-code-flow 8s linear infinite;\n  }\n\n  .blackbox-terminal__code--1 {\n    top: 15%;\n    animation-delay: -1s;\n  }\n\n  .blackbox-terminal__code--2 {\n    top: 30%;\n    color: #ffb0ba;\n    animation-delay: -4s;\n    animation-duration: 11s;\n  }\n\n  .blackbox-terminal__code--3 {\n    top: 49%;\n    animation-delay: -6s;\n    animation-duration: 7s;\n  }\n\n  .blackbox-terminal__code--4 {\n    top: 67%;\n    color: #e95d70;\n    animation-delay: -3s;\n    animation-duration: 13s;\n  }\n\n  .blackbox-terminal__code--5 {\n    top: 83%;\n    animation-delay: -8s;\n    animation-duration: 9s;\n  }\n\n  .blackbox-terminal__content {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n    display: grid;\n    min-height: 310px;\n    align-content: center;\n    justify-items: center;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .blackbox-terminal__eyebrow {\n    margin: 0 0 12px;\n    color: #ff9dab;\n    font-family: \"Consolas\", \"Courier New\", monospace;\n    font-size: .65rem;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: .18em;\n    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 92, 113, .8);\n  }\n\n  .blackbox-terminal h2 {\n    margin: 0;\n    color: #fff0f2;\n    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 6vw, 1.8rem);\n    line-height: 1.55;\n    text-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(255, 97, 120, .52);\n  }\n\n  .blackbox-terminal__message {\n    max-width: 28em;\n    margin: 16px 0 0;\n    color: rgba(255, 225, 229, .88);\n    font-size: .84rem;\n    line-height: 2;\n  }\n\n  .blackbox-terminal__status {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    margin-top: 22px;\n    padding: 6px 12px;\n    color: #ffb8c2;\n    font-family: \"Consolas\", \"Courier New\", monospace;\n    font-size: .68rem;\n    letter-spacing: .08em;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 145, 160, .45);\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    background: rgba(70, 0, 12, .55);\n  }\n\n  .blackbox-terminal__status::before {\n    width: 8px;\n    height: 8px;\n    content: \"\";\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #ff445e;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 10px #ff445e;\n    animation: blackbox-signal 1.1s steps(2, start) infinite;\n  }\n\n  .blackbox-terminal__warning {\n    margin: 18px 0 0;\n    color: #ff788b;\n    font-family: \"Consolas\", \"Courier New\", monospace;\n    font-size: .64rem;\n    letter-spacing: .08em;\n    animation: blackbox-glitch 2.8s steps(2, end) infinite;\n  }\n\n  @keyframes blackbox-code-flow {\n    from {\n      transform: translateX(10%);\n    }\n\n    to {\n      transform: translateX(-48%);\n    }\n  }\n\n  @keyframes blackbox-signal {\n    50% {\n      opacity: .18;\n      transform: scale(.72);\n    }\n  }\n\n  @keyframes blackbox-glitch {\n    0%,\n    88%,\n    100% {\n      transform: translateX(0);\n      opacity: 1;\n    }\n\n    90% {\n      transform: translateX(-3px);\n      opacity: .45;\n    }\n\n    93% {\n      transform: translateX(4px);\n      opacity: 1;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    .blackbox-terminal__code,\n    .blackbox-terminal__status::before,\n    .blackbox-terminal__warning {\n      animation: none;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"blackbox-terminal\">\n\n  <div class=\"blackbox-terminal__codes\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <p class=\"blackbox-terminal__code blackbox-terminal__code--1\">\n      01001000 01000001 01010010 01010101 01010011 01010000 01010010 01001111 01010100 01001111 01000011 01001111 01001100\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"blackbox-terminal__code blackbox-terminal__code--2\">\n      ACCESS: UNKNOWN // GATE_ID: ARIUS-███ // SIGNAL: DETECTED // WORLD_CONNECTION: UNSTABLE\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"blackbox-terminal__code blackbox-terminal__code--3\">\n      6D 69 63 68 69 6F 63 69 74 79 20 2F 2F 20 4E 4F 20 45 58 49 54 20 52 45 43 4F 52 44\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"blackbox-terminal__code blackbox-terminal__code--4\">\n      [ERROR] UNKNOWN KEY REQUIRED ... [ERROR] ACCESS DENIED ... [ERROR] GATE STILL OPEN ...\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"blackbox-terminal__code blackbox-terminal__code--5\">\n      CODE_FRAGMENT: 7A-██-09 / USER_STATUS: OBSERVED / NEXT_SIGNAL: ██████████\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"blackbox-terminal__content\">\n    <p class=\"blackbox-terminal__eyebrow\">EX BLACK BOX / SIGNAL MONITOR</p>\n\n    <h2>BLACK BOXは<br>まだ沈黙している。</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"blackbox-terminal__message\">\n      解析不能な信号が、アリウスゲートの奥から届いている。<br>\n      鍵を持つ者だけが、その先へ進める。\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"blackbox-terminal__status\">\n      SEARCHING FOR UNKNOWN CODE...\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"blackbox-terminal__warning\">\n      DO NOT ATTEMPT UNAUTHORIZED ACCESS\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:html -->",
